thub.com/Arazalera","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T11:50:26Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T11:51:05Z","body":"In that case it would make sense to overlap the probe boundaries so at a point at least 1 probe is at full opacity","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2838518105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2838542046","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105899#issuecomment-2838542046","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105899","id":2838542046,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pMLbe","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T11:58:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T11:58:21Z","body":"That would not allow for smooth transitions between probes. The reflection rendering is dependent on the order: The first probe will give full contributions (i.e. be fully opaque), except where it's blending. Consecutive probes will only contribute if `reflection_accum.a < 1.0`, and reduce their contributions by however much a pixel is already receiving reflections. If the second probe is overlapping with the first probe, and we're not talking about two probe borders overlapping, it will add up to a reflection_accum of 1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2838542046/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2839524123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105899#issuecomment-2839524123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105899","id":2839524123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pP7Mb","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T16:28:44Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T16:28:44Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2839524123/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2840207842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105899#issuecomment-2840207842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105899","id":2840207842,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pSiHi","user":{"login":"Arazalera","id":149334681,"node_id":"U_kgDOCOaqmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149334681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera","html_url":"https://github.com/Arazalera","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arazalera/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T20:47:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T20:47:01Z","body":"> That would not allow for smooth transitions between probes\r\n\r\nReflectionProbes would stack on top of each other and modify the specular value after the previous probe has modified it, so everything would be smooth, in a fork I have used that blending instead, and everything works fine","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2840207842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]